- (a) 1/2^6^ = 1/64 = 1.6%
- (b) 6/64 = 9.4%
- (c) 15/64 = 23.4%
- (d) 20/64 = 31.3%
- (e) (20+15+6+1)/64 = 42/64 = 65.6%

![Slide image 12](assets/source_fidelity/lect07b/image_012.png)

