=== layout: one-panel
@replaceme


@body

![Slide image 15](assets/source_fidelity/lect07b/image_015.png)

- a1. homozygotes\:
- there are 6 alleles and we choose 1 = 6&#160;possibilities
- a2. heterozygotes
- there are 6 alleles and we choose 2 different ones = 15 possibilities
- (a) 15 + 6 = 21 possibilities for autosomal alleles

![Slide image 16](assets/source_fidelity/lect07b/image_016.png)

@notes

Source: lect07b-prob_of_progeny.odp, slide 36.
Review: source image requires review: unsupported ODP image type: .

=== layout: one-panel
@replaceme


@body

![Slide image 16](assets/source_fidelity/lect07b/image_015.png)

- b1. female homozygotes\:
- there are 6 alleles and we choose 1 = 6&#160;possibilities
- b2. female heterozygotes
- there are 6 alleles and we choose 2 different ones = 15 possibilities
- b3. male hemizygotes
- there are 6 alleles and we choose 1 = 6&#160;possibilities

![Slide image 16](assets/source_fidelity/lect07b/image_016.png)

@notes

Source: lect07b-prob_of_progeny.odp, slide 37.
