# *Mendel's Pea Pod Color*

@left

- Yellow is dominant to green.
- In a monohybrid cross, if six plants are produced, what are the probability for each distribution of color F2
- [Divide up into your quiz groups and determine each of the following.]{color=#CC00CC}
![Slide image 18](assets/source_fidelity/lect07b/image_016.png)

- n = total seeds produced
- k = # of yellow seeds
- p = probability of getting a yellow seed


@right

- What is the probability of\:
  - 6 yellow
  - 5 yellow and 1 green
  - 4 yellow and 2 green
  - 3 yellow and 3 green
  - 2 yellow and 4 green
  - 1 yellow and 5 green
  - 6 green

@notes

Source: lect07b-prob_of_progeny.odp, slide 46.
